"""Generates port/mutations-bashanalysis.json: one deliberate defect per behavior of the bashanalysis package. Same format and
check as gen-mutations.py (each `find` must occur exactly once in its file); kept apart so the lanes' generators do not collide.
Run `pigeq mutate --unit-only --go extensions/pi-permission-system --mutations port/mutations-bashanalysis.json --sdk-dir <PiG sdk>`."""
